---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions - Courier Price Comparison"
  description="Terms and conditions of use for courierprice.com. Learn about our rate estimate disclaimer, liability limitations, and acceptable usage rules."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-grow bg-canvas-soft transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
      
      <!-- Page Hero Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-8 mb-12">
        <span class="caption-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-mute">User Agreement</span>
        <h1 class="display-lg text-ink font-semibold mt-2">Terms & Conditions.</h1>
        <p class="body-lg text-body mt-3">
          Last updated: July 9, 2026. Please read this user agreement carefully before using the courier price calculator.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections -->
      <div class="space-y-12 text-ink">
        
        <!-- Section 1 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="display-sm text-ink font-semibold">1. Acceptable Use.</h2>
          <p class="body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            By accessing and utilizing the calculator tools on courierprice.com, you agree to these Terms & Conditions. You are permitted to use this site for personal or commercial logistics cost simulation. Any unauthorized automated scraping, rate harvesting, or attempts to disrupt service availability are strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 2 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="display-sm text-ink font-semibold">2. Rate Disclaimer (Simulation Only).</h2>
          <div class="bg-canvas border border-warning/20 border-l-4 border-l-warning rounded-md p-5 shadow-level-2 transition-colors duration-200">
            <span class="caption-mono text-warning-deep font-semibold" data-i18n="results-card-price">ESTIMATED PRICE</span>
            <p class="body-sm text-body mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              <strong>CRITICAL NOTICE:</strong> All shipping estimates, delivery times, tax additions, and comparison rates generated by the courierprice.com calculator are <strong>simulations</strong> based on standard carrier rate matrices. They do not constitute official, binding bookings or contractual rate guarantees.
            </p>
            <p class="body-sm text-body mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Actual courier fees at booking time may vary due to carrier fuel adjustments, localized remote-area surcharges, physical dimensions/volumetric weight verify audits at transit depots, or selected service additions. Users are advised to confirm the final rate directly on the official carrier channels before shipping.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 3 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="display-sm text-ink font-semibold">3. Trademark & Brand Representation.</h2>
          <p class="body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            All brand carriers mentioned on courierprice.com (including but not limited to Professional Couriers, Garudavega, DTDC, India Post, Delhivery, Blue Dart, Porter, DHL, FedEx, and UPS) are trademarks and properties of their respective registered companies. courierprice.com operates independently and does not officially represent, contract for, or sell shipping services directly on behalf of these brands.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 4 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="display-sm text-ink font-semibold">4. Limitation of Liability.</h2>
          <p class="body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            courierprice.com and its operators are not liable for any financial decisions, loss of cargo, booking differences, or transit discrepancies resulting from the use of our comparison simulator. All tools and information are provided on an "as-is" basis without warranties of any kind.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Section 5 -->
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="display-sm text-ink font-semibold">5. Modifications to Terms.</h2>
          <p class="body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify these terms and calculator logic parameters at any time. Your continued use of the website following revisions confirms your acceptance of the updated user agreement. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue using our calculator tools.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
